# RelicOS boot overrides. Read by boot.scr with "env import -t" AFTER the
# built-in ADC table, so anything set here wins.
#
# CAUTION: env import loads EVERY key=value line in this file straight into
# the U-Boot environment. A stray line can overwrite variables U-Boot needs.
# Keep this file to intentional overrides only.
#
# Example: boot with the display pipeline switched off, e.g. if enabling the
# panel hangs the boot. This DTB is on the card already -- no reflash needed.
# relicos_fdt=rk3326-r36s-nopanel.dtb
